    "tutorialMemberTitle": "What are {FFFF00}Initiatives{FFFFFF}?",
    "tutorialMemberBody": "{FFFF00}Initiatives{FFFFFF} are collective faction events.\n\nThe {FFFF00}faction leader{FFFFFF} sets the minimum rank for participation and the difficulty.\n\nEvery day at different times, {FFFF00}3{FFFFFF} different initiatives are held.\nThe duration of each initiative is {FFFF00}15{FFFFFF} minutes\nEach Initiative participant receives a guaranteed reward\n{FFFF00}Players who make it into the top{FFFFFF} {FFFF00}receive an additional reward{FFFFFF}\n\n {FFFF00}Faction performance{FFFFFF} is the average value of the last 10 Initiatives\nPerformance affects {FFFF00}PayDay{FFFFFF} - the better the Initiatives are completed, the {FFFF00}higher{FFFFFF} it is\nParticipate actively in Initiatives and increase the income of the entire faction!",
